The case contains 2,347 monohull and 1,146 catamaran records with seven fields each; the supplied audit rows cover the complete benchmark tables, while no Hong Kong observations are present. I’m implementing a reproducible log-price regression with one-hot make/variant/region effects, age and length terms, grouped cross-validation, and explicit pending status for the Hong Kong comparison.
